{"version":1,"content":"<p>AMD正式發佈基於Zen 6架構的第六代EPYC 9006系列伺服器處理器，為不斷增長的人工智能、雲計算和企業級數據中心需求提供新一代計算平台。作為代號「Venice」的產品家族，新系列進一步提升了核心規模、內存帶寬以及數據傳輸能力，最高可提供256個CPU核心，成為AMD目前最強大的通用伺服器處理器之一。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585886.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T06:33:41.255070+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":159,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T06:18:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T06:27:05.639243+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T06:27:05.639243+00:00","content_hash":"c84be36118585fe66968352b2dd2aa2f802065e6fda56f9594bece0e3e8a4e95","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}